<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="scroll-smooth">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Incubadora de Negocios - <%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Sans:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            body: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
            headline: ['PT Sans', 'sans-serif'],
          },
          colors: {
            background: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            foreground: 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            card: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            'card-foreground': 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            popover: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            'popover-foreground': 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            primary: 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
            'primary-foreground': 'hsl(171 25% 95%)',
            secondary: 'hsl(169 53% 90%)',
            'secondary-foreground': 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
            muted: 'hsl(169 53% 94%)',
            'muted-foreground': 'hsl(171 40% 30%)',
            accent: 'hsl(169 53% 41%)',
            'accent-foreground': 'hsl(171 25% 98%)',
            destructive: 'hsl(0 84.2% 60.2%)',
            'destructive-foreground': 'hsl(0 0% 98%)',
            border: 'hsl(171 20% 88%)',
            input: 'hsl(171 20% 88%)',
            ring: 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
          },
          borderRadius: {
            lg: '0.5rem',
            md: 'calc(0.5rem - 2px)',
            sm: 'calc(0.5rem - 4px)',
          },
        },
      },
    }
  </script>
</head>

<body class="font-body antialiased bg-background text-foreground">
  <%- include("./templates/header.ejs", { navigationLinks: navigationLinks, title: title }) %>

  <%- include("./templates/page_header.ejs", { 
    pageTitle: "Incubadora de Negocios",
    pageDescription: "Impulsamos el desarrollo de emprendedores y nuevas empresas con asesoría especializada",
    breadcrumbs: [
      { title: "Inicio", href: "/" },
      { title: "Vinculación", href: "#" },
      { title: "Incubadora de Negocios", href: null }
    ]
  }) %>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Introduction -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          La Incubadora de Negocios de la Universidad Tecnológica de Nayarit es un espacio diseñado para 
          fomentar el espíritu emprendedor y apoyar el desarrollo de proyectos innovadores que contribuyan 
          al crecimiento económico de nuestra región.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Services Grid -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Nuestros Servicios</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          
          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary">
                <path d="M12 20h9"/>
                <path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Asesoría Empresarial</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground">
              Orientación especializada en la creación y desarrollo de planes de negocio viables y sostenibles.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                <path d="M12 16v-4"/>
                <path d="M12 8h.01"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Capacitación Continua</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground">
              Talleres y cursos sobre gestión empresarial, marketing, finanzas y desarrollo de productos.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary">
                <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
                <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
                <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
                <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Networking</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground">
              Conexión con inversionistas, mentores y otros emprendedores para crear alianzas estratégicas.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary">
                <path d="M3 3v18h18"/>
                <path d="m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Seguimiento y Evaluación</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground">
              Monitoreo constante del progreso de tu empresa y ajustes estratégicos para garantizar el éxito.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary">
                <rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                <path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Espacios de Coworking</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground">
              Acceso a instalaciones equipadas para el desarrollo de tu proyecto en un ambiente colaborativo.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-6 w-6 text-primary">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Apoyo Legal y Fiscal</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground">
              Orientación en trámites legales, fiscales y de propiedad intelectual para tu empresa.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Process Section -->
      <div class="bg-secondary/50 rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 text-center">Proceso de Incubación</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-4">
          
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              1
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Registro</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Completa tu solicitud y presenta tu idea de negocio
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              2
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Evaluación</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Análisis de viabilidad y potencial de tu proyecto
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              3
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Desarrollo</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Acompañamiento en la creación de tu plan de negocio
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              4
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Lanzamiento</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Apoyo en la puesta en marcha de tu empresa
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Section -->
      <div class="text-center bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-accent rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary-foreground mb-4">
          ¿Tienes una idea de negocio?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-primary-foreground/90 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Te ayudamos a convertirla en realidad. Únete a nuestra incubadora y recibe todo el apoyo que necesitas.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="mailto:incubadora@utnay.edu.mx" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium h-11 px-8 bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-background/90">
            Contáctanos
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+523112119800" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium h-11 px-8 border-2 border-primary-foreground text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-foreground/10">
            Llamar Ahora
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include("./templates/footer.ejs", {title: title}) %>

</body>
</html>
